<card id="c" title="Useful MacOS Apps for Developers">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p>An app for quickly uploading .ipa files to the AppStore.</p>
<p>4. <a href="http://pixelperfect-app.com/">PixelPerfect</a></p>
<p>An app for overlaying an image mockup onto a page for pixel-perfect web design.</p>
<p>5. <a href="https://www.postman.com/">Postman</a></p>
<p>A well-known app for working with APIs (debugging, testing, etc.).</p>
<p>6. <a href="https://postwoman.io/">Postwoman</a></p>
<p>Similar to Postman, but web-based.</p>
<p>7. <a href="https://github.com/kylemanna/docker-openvpn/">docker-openvpn</a></p>
<p>Create your own VPN.</p>
<p>8. <a href="https://responsively.app/">responsively.app</a></p>
<p>An app for debugging UI on various screen sizes.</p>
<p>9. <a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/">VS Code</a> Extensions</p>
<p><a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=Gruntfuggly.todo-tree">Todo-Tree</a></p>
